    "shadow": "Flat by decision: surfaces are border-defined, not elevated. Only floating overlays carry a soft shadow; the glow and button shadows are kept as tokens that resolve to none.",
    "spacing": "Birdbrain pads by density step, not by a fixed scale. Three steps are set on <html data-density>: compact (a fresh install's default), the :root default, and comfortable. Values below are the :root step; each note gives compact / comfortable. Radius is not a density concern.",
    "radius": "The scale is 2 / 4 / 6 and nothing else. xl and 2xl alias down to the 6px ceiling so every rounded-xl/rounded-2xl call site collapses with the token. rounded-full stays legal only for status pills and dots.",
